    "enUS": {
      "description": "The recipe appears to be for some sort of meat dish. It is written in a language you don't understand. Ogre is your best guess, given the source and subject matter.\r\n\r\nOgres aren't usually culinary types but, if you knew one with such an inclination, they could translate the recipe for you.",
      "dialogue": {
        "1b7f5fa5df6bbb03dd29": "Who you? Maybe Skonk first customer?",
        "764a275be49e368483d7": "You have recipe? Skonk listening."
      },
      "summary": "Find an ogre who can read the Illegible Recipe.",
      "title": "Anyone Can Cook",
